{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/19/4817584/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/19/4817584/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前はチャリティイベントに出さしていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/19/4817584/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年はただ何もできず\n『復興を願う』\nばかりでしたが"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/19/4817584/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年はこうして大好きなメンバーとチャリティイベントをさして頂き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/19/4817584/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きな乃木坂ファミリーで協力し復興をねがい！心を１つに出来まし"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/19/4817584/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に皆様に感謝します！\nこうして皆様の気持ちが募金箱にも沢山集まって......(涙)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"募金箱の後ろに立っているとき（一部）色々温かい気持ちがあふれでました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/19/4817584/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう御座いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/19/4817584/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これなかったか方もキット絶対復興を願ってくださり乃木坂ファミリー心を１つに出来たことと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/19/4817584/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒い中"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/19/4817584/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨の中"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/19/4817584/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わざわざ足を運んで下さったかたありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/19/4817584/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に感謝感謝です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/19/4817584/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様に会えて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/19/4817584/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてこうして東日本のためにすこしでも協力できたこと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/19/4817584/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の幸せをありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/19/4817584/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/19/4817584/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この人はだぁれだっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/19/4817584/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/19/4817584/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウフフ"},{"type":"image","src":"https: