graph","text":"家政婦のワダの表情が感情のない表情みたいだねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/19/4817584/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っ言われたのですが"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/19/4817584/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家政婦のワダは感情がないのを表現しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/19/4817584/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからですよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/19/4817584/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/19/4817584/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/19/4817584/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/19/4817584/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Bye"}],"source":"archive"}